                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1626a7d0-a863-3562-95f7-378b8baef552",
                        "entry_id": "ff7d6218-228d-3dba-8d48-f4e0ec18ece2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A non-member."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e92a814-e2fa-4727-bd97-47c5c598f170",
                                "sense_id": "1626a7d0-a863-3562-95f7-378b8baef552",
                                "text": "Friday evening around 8:30, you'd toil up the rickety stairs at 37 East 8th Street, perhaps stopping off for a chat in James Rosati's studio—halfway up—and watch him work on his bust of Lewitin, who was the domestic Cerberus, with a pale blue eye cocked for unwelcome unmembers."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ef5618b-4b54-4714-9267-23067fb66b92",
                                "sense_id": "1626a7d0-a863-3562-95f7-378b8baef552",
                                "text": "Calcutta the temperature-taker, the dispenser of aspirins, the receiver of Medicaid payments, the unmember of the A.M.A., the husband of a woman who can't read the arrows in parking lots because she can't see over the dashboard because she's so fat from having so many kids paid for by American tax dollars, whispered, \"Adam and Eve were Hindus.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40d7c1aa-0ab3-412f-bc48-ae36a233fba5",
                                "sense_id": "1626a7d0-a863-3562-95f7-378b8baef552",
                                "text": "The values that her family and culture held were very important to Lisa, and she fretted over the prospect of becomming an \"unmember” of her family, were she to become pregnant outside marriage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c3d7b64-a9c8-465b-8446-f8172f581a8e",
                                "sense_id": "1626a7d0-a863-3562-95f7-378b8baef552",
                                "text": "Many groups (younger people, the unwaged, the unmembers) will not belong to any organization that might possibly be involved; many of the members of the committee (e.g. clergy) cannot be said to “represent” any constituency, even if they have a valuable contribution to make to consultation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
